From 9da6a7c224309f4207da8919749c7e9c21d2b8f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bherbruck <brennen.herbruck@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:36:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: log save, open, post, generation and commands to
 the terminal (tracing)

camcraft_app::logging::init() installs a tracing-subscriber fmt layer on
stderr from both binaries, filtered by CAMCRAFT_LOG / RUST_LOG (default
info, the GPU stack at warn). Project save/open name the path and size or
why they failed; a post names the NC file, bytes, ops and time, or why
nothing was written; every generation logs its op, kind, move count and
time, or its refusal; commands log at debug.

Refs #163

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
